message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the accompanying paper (see
  preferred-citation) and this software itself using the metadata below.
type: software
title: DeflectorShieldSimulator
abstract: >-
  An interactive simulator for particle geodesics in a warp-drive
  deflector-shield spacetime, built to accompany the paper "Exploring
  Particle Geodesics in a Warp Drive Spacetime".
